## Why This Is Asked

Evaluates the ability to design real-time AI workflows with streaming data, policy enforcement, and auditable data flows under multi-tenant constraints.

## Key Concepts

- Event-driven architecture with Azure Event Hubs and Functions
- OpenAI integration behind API Management
- Grounding via Cognitive Search
- Tenant isolation via Key Vault and per-tenant credentials
- Audit trails to Data Lake
- Human-in-the-loop for critical actions

